{
    "word": "confetti",
    "lang_code": "en",
    "source_file_to_entries": {
        "raw-wiktextract-data.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "9b2a9df5-3ec6-30dd-8c4c-268721b28603",
                "word": "confetti",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "ba7ebd3d-5ae1-3816-8814-0006a94b54cd",
                        "entry_id": "9b2a9df5-3ec6-30dd-8c4c-268721b28603",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Small pieces or strips (streamers) of colored paper or other material (metal, plaster, etc) generally thrown about at festive occasions, especially at weddings and in victory celebrations."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "a0aece84-ec5c-37a7-ba05-a316a540328d",
                        "entry_id": "9b2a9df5-3ec6-30dd-8c4c-268721b28603",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Edible Italian sugar-coated almonds, especially those which are used as part of a traditional Italian wedding."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "rare",
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "d1e1f3b6-f774-4eb6-a25a-d1f8b637a50c",
                                "sense_id": "a0aece84-ec5c-37a7-ba05-a316a540328d",
                                "text": "… a pale and fair devotee of fashion who has left off eating confetti, and recovered her bloom."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "f2be03f3-1aa7-450a-92d6-b78faf626177",
                                "sense_id": "a0aece84-ec5c-37a7-ba05-a316a540328d",
                                "text": "\"Why, if you and Teresa, our own best man and maid of honor . . . oh, how wonderful that would be, to eat confetti at your wedding!\""
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "313ac087-a24f-4394-8b47-9b645825875c",
                                "sense_id": "a0aece84-ec5c-37a7-ba05-a316a540328d",
                                "text": "Emilio and Roberto had pooled their resources in money and had arranged with the cafe keeper for steaming thick chocolate, a slow-pouring syrup-like drink, the richest boccotoni, cream-filled heavy sfogliate, and almond confetti."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "cb610a01-877a-48e9-ac00-d413273a8a45",
                                "sense_id": "a0aece84-ec5c-37a7-ba05-a316a540328d",
                                "text": "There were large trays with assorted pastries and colored almond confetti for a wedding, and he remembered with a pang that this very day was the wedding anniversary, the day Pino and Maria had married (so long ago!) in Rome."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "070cb0c6-7fed-4fe6-a966-b04bd41ffd63",
                        "source_entry_id": "9b2a9df5-3ec6-30dd-8c4c-268721b28603",
                        "source_sense_description": "small pieces of colored paper generally thrown about at festive occasions",
                        "target_lang_word": "confetti",
                        "target_lang_code": "nl",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "confetti",
                                "target_lang_code": "nl",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "bc6c38ff-716c-3946-9407-a2ed87635dbc",
                                        "entry_id": "38ee01a5-41a5-383d-af51-060a5e46396e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "felgekleurde papiersnippers die tijdens feesten en optochten in de lucht gegooid worden en dan in een wolk neerdwarrelen"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3007dce5-61bd-41c9-9889-c90547fb5698",
                                                "sense_id": "bc6c38ff-716c-3946-9407-a2ed87635dbc",
                                                "text": "De carnavalsoptocht trok al hossend en confetti strooiend door de straten."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "3ceef8e5-5bc3-435b-8438-27a36ba4477c",
                        "source_entry_id": "9b2a9df5-3ec6-30dd-8c4c-268721b28603",
                        "source_sense_description": "small pieces of colored paper generally thrown about at festive occasions",
                        "target_lang_word": "confetti",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "confetti",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "bfbe1365-8c77-3d38-97ca-c39372690424",
                                        "entry_id": "f17536f8-ea50-3a70-8d61-af9890d13d56",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Rondelle en papier, parfois en plastique, et souvent colorée que l’on lance en l'air, ou sur les gens, lors des fêtes."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f6c92228-3cc8-47dc-9191-58766900a5c1",
                                                "sense_id": "bfbe1365-8c77-3d38-97ca-c39372690424",
                                                "text": "ART. 55.\nIl est également défendu de vendre et jeter des ‘confettis’ dans les rues et places de la Ville.\nART. 56.\nA l’occasion des fêtes publiques une autorisation spéciale pourra être accordée pour la vente et le jet des ‘confettis’ ainsi que pour permettre de tirer des pétards et feux d’artifices."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b88c39e3-bc8f-474b-8388-69a934c15b77",
                                                "sense_id": "bfbe1365-8c77-3d38-97ca-c39372690424",
                                                "text": "C’est le dimanche du carnaval. […] Les autos passent, remplies de fêtards qui s’envoient des confetti ; les jeunes aspergent les femmes de parfum."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ed737e0a-d514-41d8-9584-bfcbe3e01882",
                                                "sense_id": "bfbe1365-8c77-3d38-97ca-c39372690424",
                                                "text": "Il […] éventre des classeurs, des fichiers remplis de paperasses et il en répand le contenu dans les airs, l’éparpille à poignées comme des confetti !"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "85dc72b7-522f-436a-ae6a-4aa1ac553edc",
                        "source_entry_id": "9b2a9df5-3ec6-30dd-8c4c-268721b28603",
                        "source_sense_description": "small pieces of colored paper generally thrown about at festive occasions",
                        "target_lang_word": "Konfetti",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Konfetti",
